url: "https://github.com/MNajeraR/Kraken-2Stage-Optical-Design"

abstract: >
  Implementation of a two-stage optical design workflow for astronomical
  focal reducer systems, including first-order paraxial modeling,
  third-order aberration optimization, glass selection, physically grounded
  merit function (PGMF) optimization, and RMS-based image-quality refinement.

keywords:
  - optics
  - optical-design
  - astronomy
  - ray-tracing
  - optimization
  - KrakenOS
  - astrophysics
